OL,3,AWest warns of famine risk in Sudan as
OL,4,Acivil war grinds on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US and 30 other Western states have
OL,7,Fwarned of an "alarming deterioration"
OL,8,Fin food security in Sudan, urging the
OL,9,Fwarring sides in the civil war to
OL,10,Fremove obstacles to humanitarian aid to
OL,11,Fprevent famine.
OL,13,FIn a joint statement, the signatories
OL,14,Fsaid conflict was the main driver of
OL,15,FSudan's hunger crisis, damaging
OL,16,Fcritical infrastructure and disrupting
OL,17,Ffood production.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
