OL,3,AWest warns of famine risk in Sudan as
OL,4,Acivil war grinds on
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There is very little to survive on,"
OL,7,FYusuf Roble, regional director for
OL,8,FIslamic Relief East Africa, told BBC
OL,9,FNewsday, describing how people
OL,10,Freturning to Omdurman were finding
OL,11,Ftheir homes destroyed or looted.
OL,13,FThe war, which began in April 2023, has
OL,14,Fdisplaced 14 million people.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
